READING
========================================================================================================
  configurations: 12
  resolved POSITIVE under Breslow: 12/12
  resolved POSITIVE under KP:      3/12

  SOME configurations DO show a resolved grouped advantage under KP.
  That contradicts the 21/21 in-sample result and must be reported
  rather than reconciled -- it would mean the KP-null is a property
  of the original cohorts and not of the estimator.
